            "notes": "ALWAYS RUSH [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5). Huge amount of AP and makes GA CD start whenever you do a movement tech (Superjump and Slingshot). This item is a must have to make Whambulance not as clunky and also allows you to build into raw stats more than cooldown reduction so be willing to sell all your common items for it. Look to prioritize Horizontal movement through slingshots to maximize the most amount of healing from [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9).\n\nIf you are poor then buy Weapon items like [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) and [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) to help you come back from a bad Round 1.\n\nSelling Order: [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) > [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) > [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)",
