            "notes": "[Tethered Tourniquet](item_9ac02f9a-7c06-46a3-94d4-2ba9a9cf623f) allows us to start pistoling in order to farm damage and eliminations for money. \n\nA general tip for Tethered Tourniquet is always build your stacks before fights and rounds. While we aim to get max stacks before a fight, during a fight we look to pistol when you have 5-6 stacks of Tourniquet since this gives you enough stacks for one whole mag. Having more than 6 stacks is not necessarily bad but having to reload makes you inactive and that time reloading would be better spent using your staff. Your staff auto reloads your gun after about 2 seconds so don\u2019t be afraid to swap to staff if you have to reload. I usually go for full stacks during a fight if I plan to valk since I won\u2019t have to reload so I can continuously shoot.\n\nPrioritize max stats as this will help make sure you do not fall behind.",
