            "created_at": "2025-09-19T09:10:38.145067+00:00",
            "notes": "You have 3 main options for powers. [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) , [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb) , and [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1).\n\n95% of the time you should pick [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) since it gels well with the playstyle of the build but [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb)is good for ability heavy team comps and [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) is good for your own survival specifically against dive. Choose what you think is most important in your match up.\n\nFor max build, we look to buy [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) and [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) since they give the most stats but if you can't buy both items then consider the alternative items below and maximize stats as best as you can with the cash available.",
